B2B Sales & Pipeline Analytics
📝 Project Overview
End-to-end BI solution transforming raw CRM data into strategic insights for a B2B industrial hardware company. This dashboard monitors revenue growth, pipeline efficiency, and team performance across global regions.

🛠️ Tech Stack
SQL (MySQL): Data engineering, cleaning (handling "NODATA" & string inconsistencies), and creating optimized Views for BI consumption.

Power BI: Data modeling (Star Schema) and interactive report design.

DAX: Advanced measures for Time Intelligence and sales conversion KPIs.

💡 Key Insights
Revenue Analysis: Sales breakdown by Sector (Tech, Medical, Retail) and Product Series (GTX, MG).

Pipeline Efficiency: Win Rate tracking and opportunity conversion by Manager.

Price Compliance: Comparing MSRP vs. Close Value to monitor discount trends.

